1	//! DAG assembly: the version root addressed by its `contentCid`
2	//! (blueprint/engine.md "Content plane": "assembles a DAG addressed by the
3	//! version's `contentCid`, shaped so ranged block/CAR fetches map
4	//! chunk-aligned").
5	//!
6	//! The DAG *shape* is engine-owned (an open edge); the *encoding* and the
7	//! content-address are core's — the root node is serialized with core's
8	//! deterministic CBOR ([`cipherbox_core::codec`], a strict DAG-CBOR subset) and
9	//! addressed by [`cipherbox_core::content::compute_cid`] under the engine-chosen
10	//! `dag-cbor` codec, so there is one codec and one KAT set (AGENTS.md rules 4-5).
11	//!
12	//! Shape today is a single flat root over the ordered leaf CIDs plus the fixed
13	//! chunk size and the plaintext length. Flat keeps the byte→leaf map trivial
14	//! (offset / chunkSize), which is exactly the chunk-alignment a ranged fetch
15	//! needs; a fan-out/balancing profile is the open edge deferred with the chunk
16	//! size (blueprint/engine.md "Open edges").
17	
18	use cipherbox_core::codec::{Map, Value, decode, encode};
19	use cipherbox_core::content::{
20	    CONTENT_CID_CODEC, CONTENT_CID_LEN, CONTENT_CID_MULTIHASH, compute_cid,
21	};
22	use cipherbox_core::error::{CodecError, Malformed};
23	
